01:53:12.566 --> 01:53:15.966
Ah, enaknya.

01:53:29.233 --> 01:53:30.833
Ah, enak banget.

01:53:32.833 --> 01:53:40.833
Ah, hajar terus di situ.

01:53:42.100 --> 01:53:43.400
Ah, di situ.

01:53:43.900 --> 01:53:44.166
Di sini?

01:53:44.500 --> 01:53:45.600
Iya, otw.

01:53:55.900 --> 01:53:56.900
Ah.

01:54:12.033 --> 01:54:13.033
Ah, dia pergi.

01:54:13.133 --> 01:54:16.800
Ah, sial.

01:54:20.000 --> 01:54:26.100
Iya, iya, iya. Boleh
aku balik badan?

01:54:31.200 --> 01:54:32.300
Yuto.

01:54:33.500 --> 01:54:34.733
Taruh paling dalam.

01:54:35.633 --> 01:54:36.633
Oke.

01:54:36.866 --> 01:54:37.866
Paling ujung, ya.

01:54:39.166 --> 01:54:40.766
Ah, nikmatnya.

01:54:47.866 --> 01:54:48.866
Oke, paham.

01:54:49.000 --> 01:54:50.300
Aku masukin paling dalam ya.

01:54:51.500 --> 01:54:52.500
Keluar.

01:54:58.133 --> 01:54:59.900
Cuma Yuto yang keluar.

01:55:17.333 --> 01:55:19.900
Yuto, itu yang paling banyak
keluar selama ini, kan?

01:55:21.000 --> 01:55:22.500
Banyak banget keluarnya.

01:55:26.566 --> 01:55:33.533
Ah, tapi punya Kakak
masih keluar. Masih keluar?

01:55:37.700 --> 01:55:40.733
Sakit, bikin
tenggorokan jadi bolong.

01:55:44.200 --> 01:55:47.933
Aku ingin lebih banyak
lagi dari Kakak. Jangan lari.

01:55:52.533 --> 01:55:54.500
Agresif banget ya.

01:56:03.433 --> 01:56:16.100
Enak banget. Bisa
lanjut bareng Kakak?

01:56:17.333 --> 01:56:18.600
Aku mau ikut.

01:56:23.266 --> 01:56:26.500
Bisa dipakai pas
pergi sama Kakak.

01:56:28.100 --> 01:56:30.400
Pas kita pergi nanti ya.

01:56:31.033 --> 01:56:32.666
Ah, tapi enak juga.

01:56:39.033 --> 01:56:40.033
Tunggu sebentar.

01:56:41.533 --> 01:56:42.833
Aduh, aduh, aduh.

01:56:58.166 --> 01:57:01.166
Akhirnya bisa
keluar bareng Kakak.

01:57:20.466 --> 01:57:22.533
Kental banget yang keluar.

01:57:30.200 --> 01:57:33.300
Kakak mungkin
nggak akan keluar lagi.

01:57:43.000 --> 01:57:44.333
Tidak apa-apa.

01:57:44.833 --> 01:57:48.100
Soalnya keluarnya jauh lebih
banyak daripada orang biasa di sana.

01:57:49.433 --> 01:57:50.433
Begitu ya.

01:58:03.766 --> 01:58:13.633
Besok masih di rumah kakak,
kan? Kalau gitu, besok lanjut lagi?

01:58:14.800 --> 01:58:15.800
Mau.

01:58:19.466 --> 01:58:23.066
Ya sudah, besok
kubikin hamil lagi ya, Kak.

01:58:38.800 --> 01:58:41.100
Besok taruh sini
yang banyak lagi ya.

01:58:42.233 --> 01:58:43.233
Aku keluarin banyak ya.

01:58:53.200 --> 01:58:54.500
Pratinjau Episode Berikutnya
